<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Swift on 오깅중</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/tags/swift/</link><description>Recent content in Swift on 오깅중</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:25:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://jun7680.github.io/tags/swift/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Swift 6에서 매일 만나는 변화 7가지 — strict concurrency부터 typed throws까지</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swift-6-language-changes/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 15:25:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swift-6-language-changes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Swift 6가 풀린 지 한참 됐는데 5.10에서 곧장 6으로 점프하면 컴파일 에러가 줄줄이 뜨는 게 정상이다. 가장 큰 이유는 &lt;strong&gt;strict concurrency 검사가 기본 켜진&lt;/strong&gt; 것. 그 외에도 매일 만지는 코드에 영향이 큰 변화들이 꽤 있다. 한 번 정리해 둔다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Swift mutating인데 self를 안 바꾸는 함수 — 컴파일 통과하는 시그니처의 함정</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swift-mutating-without-self-mutation/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 14:20:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swift-mutating-without-self-mutation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;PR 리뷰에서 이런 코드를 봤다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;UserPreferences&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;isEnabledAll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Bool&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;let&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;isEnabledFeatureA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Bool&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// ... 20개 더 ...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;mutating&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;updated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledAll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Bool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledFeatureA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;Bool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// ... 동일하게 22개 ...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;Self&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;init&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledAll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledAll&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;??&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledAll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledFeatureA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledFeatureA&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;??&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledFeatureA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// ...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;호출부.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-swift" data-lang="swift"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;guard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;subject&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;useCases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;update&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;updated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;isEnabledFeatureA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;options&lt;/code&gt;가 재할당되지도 않는데 &lt;code&gt;var&lt;/code&gt;다. &lt;code&gt;let&lt;/code&gt;으로 바꾸자고 제안하니 &amp;ldquo;해당 메서드가 &lt;code&gt;mutating&lt;/code&gt;이라 &lt;code&gt;var&lt;/code&gt;가 필요합니다. &lt;code&gt;let&lt;/code&gt;으로 바꾸면 빌드가 실패합니다&amp;quot;라는 답이 왔다. 컴파일러는 정말 그렇게 시킨다. 그런데 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;mutating&lt;/code&gt;일 이유가 있는가?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Realm에서 SwiftData로: 42개 모델을 옮기는 전략과 함정 (Part 2 — Primary Key 함정 3가지)</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/realm-to-swiftdata-migration-part-2-primary-key-traps/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 11:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/realm-to-swiftdata-migration-part-2-primary-key-traps/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TL;DR&lt;/strong&gt; — SwiftData &lt;code&gt;@Attribute(.unique)&lt;/code&gt; Primary Key를 쓰다 silent로 무너지는 3가지를 만났다. ① &lt;code&gt;.invalidInt&lt;/code&gt; 같은 sentinel을 PK 기본값으로 두면 row 충돌이 난다. ② &lt;code&gt;String.hashValue&lt;/code&gt;는 프로세스 재시작마다 시드가 랜덤이라 PK가 안 맞는다. ③ &lt;code&gt;#Predicate&lt;/code&gt; 안에서 enum 비교는 silent fail 한다. &lt;strong&gt;결정적 해시(Boost &lt;code&gt;hash_combine&lt;/code&gt; 포팅) + rawValue 컬럼 분리 + lookup-then-upsert&lt;/strong&gt;로 막았다. 총 6편 시리즈의 &lt;strong&gt;2편(Primary Key 함정 편)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Swift 5.7에서 매일 쓰는 개선 7가지</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swift-5.7%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EB%A7%A4%EC%9D%BC-%EC%93%B0%EB%8A%94-%EA%B0%9C%EC%84%A0-7%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jun 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/swift-5.7%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EB%A7%A4%EC%9D%BC-%EC%93%B0%EB%8A%94-%EA%B0%9C%EC%84%A0-7%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;WWDC 2022에서 Swift 5.7이 같이 풀렸다. 보통은 이런 마이너 버전에 큰 변화가 없는데, 5.7은 일상 코드에 영향을 주는 변경이 꽤 많아서 한 번 정리해 둔다. 다 적으면 너무 길어지니까 매일 쓰게 되는 7가지만 추렸다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>